    "description": "This is data collected for programs over the 2023-2024 Fiscal Year (July 2023 - June 2024). The data was collected and compiled by the Youth Development Department with support from all City departments. \n\nThe Youth Development Department defines youth programs and services as any that a) are created with youth (ages 0 to 25) in mind and can contribute to positive youth development or b) a service, program, or activity which includes a substantive proportion of youth. Funding amounts largely exclude direct and indirect salaries for staff involved in youth programming.\n\nWhenever available, data is represented. Otherwise, cells are empty.",
